{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>When the music starts, the world of the dead and the world of the living collide...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602550/extras/d5f0ec6656db4e3847bc05f0c7cc48ac.apng?t=1761318088\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602550/extras/d5f0ec6656db4e3847bc05f0c7cc48ac.poster.avif?t=1761318088\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=80 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Listen to the beat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual platforming with a rhythmic twist - jump through the gorgeously decorated rooms of a Peranakan mansion where platforms and obstacles are controlled by the beat. At the end of each zone, defeat a demonic auntie with a penchant for musical mahjong. From vanishing platforms to extreme gardening, each zone has new and unique challenges to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make friends and play mini-games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend a colourful cast of demons and ghosts and lend them a helping hand: Serve breakfast at a kopi tiam at rush hour, star in a demon's deadly game show, and  make the world's best fishing game with your otter friend. Helping your friends may change the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a unique world inspired by Peranakan culture </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From deadly banquets to tranquil gardens, explore the beautiful and spooky environments of a Peranakan mansion. Fill your journal with local foods and cultural references from South East Asia.</p><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602550/extras/c545a7426c309cb780e48af4d2267970.poster.avif?t=1761318088\" 